  {
    "id": "formal-methods",
    "title": "形式化方法",
    "description": "能否在明确假设和模型下证明系统满足某个性质？",
    "date": "2026-10-09",
    "tags": [
      "验证",
      "约束",
      "证明"
    ],
    "difficulty": "进阶",
    "estimatedReadingTime": 4,
    "prerequisites": [
